# dm2find.com  →  DM2find.ai/travel
#
# Separate Coolify application on purpose: the redirect keeps working while the
# main site container is rebuilding.
#
# ⚠️  app.dm2find.com is a white-label chatbotbuilder.ai deployment (Sijthoff,
#     Nyenrode) on different infrastructure. It is NOT handled here and must keep
#     resolving. Only the apex and www records point at this container — never a
#     wildcard, or the white label goes down with it.
#
# Coolify's Traefik terminates TLS in front of this, so we listen plain on :80.

:80 {
	# Flat redirect. Deliberately no {uri}: the old .com paths have no
	# counterpart under /travel, so appending them would 404. If specific .com
	# URLs turn out to matter, add explicit `redir` lines ABOVE this one.
	redir https://dm2find.ai/travel 301
}
